Package: nabu-autobrightness
Version: 1.0.0-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Kumar-Jy <https://github.com/Kumar-Jy>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Depends: python3, python3-gi, iio-sensor-proxy, libnotify-bin
Description: Intelligent ambient light auto-brightness daemon and toggle for Xiaomi Pad 5 (nabu)
 Monitors the Xiaomi Pad 5 ambient light sensor over IIO / SLPI and smoothly adjusts screen
 backlight brightness according to configurable lux curves.
